id: pm-r1f9f1
title: Compact compound lifecycle receipts without losing SDK results
description: "Temporary acceptance with an 18000-byte description measured plain claim JSON at 160 bytes and claim --start at 37193 bytes, including two full item snapshots. Add explicit compact CLI/MCP presentation for compound lifecycle operations while retaining full public SDK results, full-output access and documented compatibility behavior."
