status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-11T14:43:44.220Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-11T16:48:52.564Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#dda31a0f9a000eeb4731c29d"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Cover claim --start, release --pause and close --release-assignment through shared presentation contracts; preserve complete typed SDK results and explicit full output; compact receipts report truthful ownership, lifecycle state and partial success; verify installed large-metadata CLI/MCP sessions and legacy alias compatibility"
value: Reduce repeated context cost for agent lifecycle loops
outcome: Compound lifecycle receipts scale with changed fields rather than complete item metadata
why_now: Real acceptance during PR 1237 review closeout exposed a 232-fold response expansion for claim --start
parent: pm-mpbb
risk: medium
confidence: high
