comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-11T14:43:44.220Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status searches for claim start receipt (70 hits) and start compact (112 hits), refreshed open and in_progress inventories, and full metadata of pm-eqdo85 and pm-eq4x. Plain claim compact receipts and lifecycle aliases are shipped; compound envelopes were intentionally preserved for compatibility. This is a distinct presentation enhancement, not a reopened historical defect. Measured in a disposable tracker with telemetry disabled; no repository items were used as test fixtures."
  "2026-09-11T16:29:31.560Z","harness:codex","large-metadata compound receipt test failed on the baseline. Shared projection now preserves complete typed SDK results and bounds CLI/MCP canonical and alias receipts. Real failed-update acceptance verifies persisted ownership and explicit no-rollback recovery. Twelve focused tests passed across lifecycle compositions, projection integrity, and UX. Full coverage and static checks are running. Only pm-r1f9f1 and pm-gdi7 are active in this implementation worktree."
  "2026-09-11T16:30:51.143Z","harness:codex","Live operational inventory: no open GitHub issues and only existing PR 1237; open Dependabot, code-scanning, and secret-scanning alert APIs each returned empty arrays. Credential scan passed and pnpm audit reported no known vulnerabilities. Outdated inventory contains only out-of-range major upgrades (Vitest 5, TypeScript 7, npm-package-arg 14), not compatible-range patches. PR 1237 latest release-note review is corrected through its canonical item and package generation on its existing branch."
  "2026-09-11T16:33:35.028Z","harness:codex","Live release evidence: successful Auto Release recovery run 34582052985 verified the existing successful Release workflow 34576128355 for immutable v2026.9.11. The latest scheduled run initially failed, so this is a successful recovery receipt rather than a claim that the schedule never fails. Public npm and pm-changelog latest versions are both 2026.9.11. No second automatic tag or same-day publication was requested."
  "2026-09-11T16:35:29.081Z","harness:codex","Manual temporary-project acceptance passed with Experiment custom type, numeric sample_count field, and 31000-byte description. Built CLI emitted start=378 bytes, pause=378 bytes, close=458 bytes and closed-list=865 bytes. Explicit full alias output and full get retained description and custom value; closure released assignment; strict history and resolution/drift validation passed. Temporary data was removed."
  "2026-09-11T16:48:52.564Z","harness:codex","Packed-artifact acceptance passed under Node and Bun, including a real stateless MCP start-task request with a 1079-byte receipt for 31000-byte item metadata. Canonical CLI and legacy full-output paths retain custom values. Published 2026.9.11 independently passed npm/Bun 11-step agent sessions and npx/bunx CLI/MCP discovery and negative controls. Required observability gate passed with zero recent blocking Sentry issues, 2.15% telemetry finish error rate, no missing error codes, matching recent start/finish counts and an empty physical delivery queue. PR 1237 is merged after exact-head checks and inline verification; quota-blocked full review reruns may be skipped per user instruction."
